ent （ヤンキー） and likes to read all types of comics as well as play games and various sports. I'd like you to draw him with his mouth closed expressions, and the composition and pose are up to you. If needed you can add any props, such as comic books game consoles. If you want, you may draw him slightly injured as well.\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/folderview?id=15FfsWFh-Ejn2Zi0I-4Bd-rtrTfGOVTRC", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kabedad/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bea9bb74/uploads/origins/e7e61a6a-2d4f-453a-9e4c-634dfd8032bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eeaadc4ff8d2e1ff27eafabf26fa7c07", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bea9bb74/uploads/origins/e7e61a6a-2d4f-453a-9e4c-634dfd8032bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eeaadc4ff8d2e1ff27eafabf26fa7c07, https://si.imgix.net/bea9bb74/uploads/origins/e7e61a6a-2d4f-453a-9e4c-634dfd8032bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bfa7b11a42901597834abe80c8bed554 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bea9bb74/uploads/origins/e7e61a6a-2d4f-453a-9e4c-634dfd8032bb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=959d440fb2d3ecf6aa18b03b70a0817b 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2070935, "client_id": 837290, "nc": 33}, {"path": "/@kabedad/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2070935, "client_i